description.content:
This API provides endpoints to configure the Nortech AI Live API by selecting signals to be exported as MQTT messages. Data can then be consumed from `mqtts://live.data.apps.nor.tech` at topics with structure `<format>/workspaces/<workspaceId>/assets/<assetId>/divisions/<divisionId>/units/<unitId>/signals/<signalId>` where `<format>` is one of `json` or `protobuf`. At the moment, the single-level wildcard (+) is not supported.

### Protobuf Schema

```
  syntax = "proto3";

  message DataPoint {
      uint64 timestamp = 1;
      oneof value {
          bool bool_value = 2;
          double double_value = 3;
          string string_value = 4;
      }
  }
```
